  "storyGuardianPrologueWelcome": "Hi, I'm Tino! I'll show you how every piece moves.",
  "storyGuardianProloguePuzzleOk": "You got it! You already know how the pieces move.",
  "storyGuardianProloguePuzzleRetry": "Almost! Look at where each piece can go and try again.",
  "storyGuardianPrologueBoss": "Shall we play a game? I'll start gently, I promise.",
  "storyGuardianPrologueLessonDone": "Now you know the pieces. Let's see you use them.",
  "storyGuardianVillageWelcome": "Welcome to the village! Here I'll teach you not to leave pieces hanging.",
  "storyGuardianVillagePuzzleOk": "Well done, you spotted it right away!",
  "storyGuardianVillagePuzzleRetry": "Nearly there: look for the undefended piece.",
  "storyGuardianVillageBoss": "Now it's you and me. I love the Italian Game, watch out!",
  "storyGuardianVillageLessonDone": "Well done, no loose pieces. Time to test them.",
  "storyGuardianGatesWelcome": "You only get through the gates by knowing the rules. Let's go through them in order.",
  "storyGuardianGatesPuzzleOk": "Exactly: a promotion at the right moment.",
  "storyGuardianGatesPuzzleRetry": "Not yet: check the rules again and try once more.",
  "storyGuardianGatesBoss": "A game to check: I'll play the Queen's Gambit.",
  "storyGuardianGatesLessonDone": "You've learned the rules. The puzzles await.",
  "storyGuardianTowerWelcome": "This tower is climbed with checkmates. Let's begin.",
  "storyGuardianTowerPuzzleOk": "Checkmate! Straight to the point.",
  "storyGuardianTowerPuzzleRetry": "No, look at the king: where can't it escape?",
  "storyGuardianTowerBoss": "Enough theory: let's play. I attack with the King's Gambit.",
  "storyGuardianTowerLessonDone": "You see how to checkmate. Now find the hidden ones.",
  "storyGuardianForestWelcome": "In the forest every branch hides a trap. Eyes open!",
  "storyGuardianForestPuzzleOk": "Ha, you didn't fall for the trap. Well done!",
  "storyGuardianForestPuzzleRetry": "Oops, the trap worked. Try again!",
  "storyGuardianForestBoss": "Let's see if you can set your own. I play the English.",
  "storyGuardianForestLessonDone": "Traps won't fool you anymore. Practise setting them.",
  "storyGuardianCastleWelcome": "In endgames every move counts. Calmly, one step at a time.",
  "storyGuardianCastlePuzzleOk": "Patient and precise: that's how you win an endgame.",
  "storyGuardianCastlePuzzleRetry": "No rush: count the moves and try again.",
  "storyGuardianCastleBoss": "A slow game awaits us. I play the Sicilian.",
  "storyGuardianCastleLessonDone": "Few pieces, every move counts. Now the puzzles.",
  "storyGuardianCrownWelcome": "The crown is won from the start: an elegant opening is half the game.",
  "storyGuardianCrownPuzzleOk": "Elegant: that's the right move.",
  "storyGuardianCrownPuzzleRetry": "Close: think about developing your pieces and try again.",
  "storyGuardianCrownBoss": "May I have a game? I choose the Spanish.",
  "storyGuardianCrownLessonDone": "Centre, development, castling: all yours. Now the puzzles.",
  "storyGuardianPlainWelcome": "On the plain you win with a plan. I'll show you how.",
  "storyGuardianPlainPuzzleOk": "Exactly. A clear plan beats haste.",
  "storyGuardianPlainPuzzleRetry": "Close. Think about what your piece wants.",
  "storyGuardianPlainBoss": "Shall we play? Fair warning: I love the Evans Gambit.",
  "storyGuardianPlainLessonDone": "You have a plan and active pieces. Now the puzzles.",
  "storyGuardianAcademyWelcome": "At the academy you learn from the masters. Come on, show me what you know!",
  "storyGuardianAcademyPuzzleOk": "Great! That's how masters play.",
  "storyGuardianAcademyPuzzleRetry": "Don't give up: breathe and try again.",
  "storyGuardianAcademyBoss": "The final challenge: I play the King's Indian. No discounts!",
  "storyGuardianAcademyLessonDone": "Lessons done, scholar. Now the test on the field.",
